graph TB
    subgraph Repo["llm-d-autoscaling repository (main @ b6be439)"]
        direction TB
        subgraph Current["Current deliverables (no runtime)"]
            Guides["KEDA blueprints<br/>benchmark/config/scenarios/guides/<br/>prefill/decode ScaledObjects"]
            Staging["Staging scenarios<br/>scenarios/staging/<br/>baseline, queue-aggressive, kv-early,<br/>token-aware, LWS P/D"]
            Bench["Benchmark test bed<br/>benchmark/<br/>llm-d-benchmark specs, Grafana dashboards"]
            KindEmu["Kind GPU emulator<br/>hack/kind-emulator/"]
        end

        subgraph Legacy["legacy/ - WVA controller (DEPRECATED, frozen, no CI)"]
            direction TB
            Manager["controller-manager<br/>legacy/cmd/main.go<br/>:8081 probes, :8443 metrics"]
            CMRec[ConfigMapReconciler]
            HPARec[HPAReconciler]
            SORec["ScaledObjectReconciler<br/>conditional on keda.sh CRD"]
            IPRec["InferencePoolReconciler<br/>v1 + v1alpha2"]
            SatEngine["Saturation engine<br/>leader-elected, 15s / 60s OCP"]
            SFZ["Scale-from-zero engine<br/>leader-elected"]
            Coord["Coordinator + gpurebalance<br/>experimental, off by default"]
            CRDWatch["CRD watcher<br/>restart on late KEDA/LWS CRD"]
            Manager --> CMRec
            Manager --> HPARec
            Manager --> SORec
            Manager --> IPRec
            Manager --> SatEngine
            Manager --> SFZ
            Manager --> Coord
            Manager --> CRDWatch
        end
    end

    User[Platform Engineer / User] -->|applies| Guides
    Guides -->|defines| ScaledObject["KEDA ScaledObject"]
    Staging -->|defines variants of| ScaledObject
    Bench -->|evaluates| Guides
    Bench -->|evaluates| Staging
    KindEmu -->|hosts| Bench

    ScaledObject -->|reconciled by| KEDA[KEDA operator]
    KEDA -->|PromQL triggers| Prom["Prometheus / Thanos Querier"]
    KEDA -->|manages| HPA["HorizontalPodAutoscaler"]
    HPA -->|scales| ModelServers["llm-d model servers<br/>vLLM Deployments / LeaderWorkerSets"]

    User -->|"annotates llm-d.ai/managed"| HPA
    User -->|"annotates llm-d.ai/managed"| ScaledObject
    HPARec -->|watches| HPA
    SORec -->|watches| ScaledObject
    IPRec -->|watches| InferencePool["InferencePool<br/>gateway-api-inference-extension"]
    CMRec -->|watches| ConfigMaps["manager-config /<br/>saturation-scaling ConfigMaps"]
    SatEngine -->|queries| Prom
    SatEngine -->|scrapes HTTP| EPP["EPP pods<br/>endpoint picker"]
    SatEngine -->|"exports wva_desired_replicas"| Prom
    SFZ -->|"writes scale subresource"| ModelServers
    Coord -->|"patches spec.maxReplicas"| HPA
    Coord -->|"patches spec.maxReplicas"| ScaledObject
    InferencePool -->|locates| EPP

    style Guides fill:#4a90e2
    style Staging fill:#4a90e2
    style Bench fill:#4a90e2
    style KindEmu fill:#4a90e2
    style Manager fill:#b0b0b0,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style CMRec fill:#b0b0b0
    style HPARec fill:#b0b0b0
    style SORec fill:#b0b0b0
    style IPRec fill:#b0b0b0
    style SatEngine fill:#b0b0b0
    style SFZ fill:#b0b0b0
    style Coord fill:#b0b0b0,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style CRDWatch fill:#b0b0b0
    style ScaledObject fill:#f5a623
    style HPA fill:#f5a623
    style InferencePool fill:#f5a623
    style ConfigMaps fill:#f5a623
    style KEDA fill:#e8e8e8
    style Prom fill:#e8e8e8
    style ModelServers fill:#7ed321
    style EPP fill:#7ed321
